d normbydate --- Normalize a variable by a baseline date
d This package provides the normbydate ado command and its help file.
d The command normalizes a variable by its value at a specified baseline
d date, optionally within by-groups. See the help file for usage and
d examples.
d Distribution-Date: 11 Oct 2025
F normbydate.ado    normbydate ado command
F normbydate.sthlp  help file for normbydate
F test.do           self-contained tests (built-in datasets)
F README.md         project README

